</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># MOD=998244353</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># res=1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># for i in range(341799):</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     if i%2!=0:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#         res=(res*5)%MOD</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     else:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#         res=(res*21)%MOD</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># res=(res*res*res*(21**4))%MOD</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># print(res)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>MOD=998244353</code>：定义模数。</li>\n<li><code>res=1</code>：初始化结果。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(341799)</code>：循环执行 341799 次。</li>\n<li><code>if i%2!=0</code>：判断 i 是否为奇数。</li>\n<li><code>res=(res*5)%MOD</code>：奇数情况下更新 res。</li>\n<li><code>else</code>：偶数情况下更新 res。</li>\n<li><code>res=(res*res*res*(21**4))%MOD</code>：最后一步计算。</li>\n<li><code>print(res)</code>：输出结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>空间优化：没有使用额外的空间。</li>\n<li>时间优化：避免了递推，直接计算结果。</li>\n<li>代码优化：代码简洁，易于理解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(1)</